---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy policy – Nirav Sampat"
  description="How niravsampat.com and Nirav Sampat's poutreach email tool handle data."
  path="/privacy/"
>
  <article class="policy">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated 19 October 2026</p>

    <h2>This website</h2>
    <p>
      niravsampat.com is my personal portfolio. It sets no cookies and runs no analytics,
      advertising or tracking scripts. It is hosted on Cloudflare Pages, which processes
      standard technical information (such as your IP address and browser) to deliver the
      pages, and its fonts are served by Google Fonts.
    </p>

    <h2>poutreach, my email tool</h2>
    <p>
      poutreach is a private tool I built for my own use. The Google app named "poutreach"
      connects only to my own Google accounts, with permission to read and send email. It
      sends individual emails I have written or approved, and reads the replies to them. It
      is not offered to anyone else.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Google user data it reads stays on my own computer. It is never sold, shared for
        advertising, or used to build profiles.</li>
      <li>The text of a reply may be processed by Anthropic's Claude API only to sort it
        (for example "interested" or "not now"), so I can answer it.</li>
      <li>Anthropic does not use API data to train its models by default.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>If I have emailed you</h2>
    <p>
      I keep your name, work email address, job title and company, which come from public
      business sources (Apollo) and your company's website, plus whether you replied. I use
      them only to write to you, to avoid writing twice, and to respect a request to stop.
      Email addresses are checked for deliverability with ZeroBounce before I write.
    </p>
    <p>
      To stop hearing from me, reply "stop" to any email. To have your details deleted,
      email <a href="mailto:nirav@niravsampat.com">nirav@niravsampat.com</a> and I will
      remove them.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Nirav Sampat, <a href="mailto:nirav@niravsampat.com">nirav@niravsampat.com</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy { max-width: 42rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.25rem 4rem; line-height: 1.6; }
  .policy h1 { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .policy .updated { opacity: 0.7; margin-top: 0; }
  .policy h2 { margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  .policy ul { padding-left: 1.2rem; }
  .policy li { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
</style>
